  "body": "🤖 This is an automatic issue report for Web IDL syntax error. 🤖\n\n[webidl2.js](https://github.com/w3c/webidl2.js) says:\n\n```\nSyntax error at line 10 in html,89, since `interface CustomElementRegistry`:\n  undefined initialize((Node) root);\n                            ^\n```\n\n> Error: At least two types are expected in a union type but found less\n\nPlease file an issue at https://github.com/saschanaz/webidl-updater/issues/new if you think this is invalid or should be enhanced.\n",
